  "description": "Marshall Valvestate 8100 (model 8080/8100 preamp, Iss.1), overdrive channel. Input buffer, op-amp gain stage with GAIN pot, diode clipper, ECC83 on the low HT rail, Marshall-style tone stack, volume and output op-amp (contour left out). Knobs are set as a starting point for a tight, mid-forward Chuck Schuldiner death-metal voicing. Parts values are partly read from a low-resolution scan and partly estimated; power amp not modelled.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "GAIN",
      "BASS",
      "MID",
      "TREBLE",
      "VOLUME"
    ]
  },
  "name": "Marshall Valvestate 8100 - OD (Chuck Schuldiner)",
